---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ReturnButton from '../components/ReturnButton';
---

<Layout 
  title="Legal Notices | hoGAMEGATA" 
  description="Legal notices, intellectual property disclaimers, copyright policies, and fair use statements for the hoGAMEGATA horror game database." 
  withSearch={false} 
  withLink={true}
>
  <!-- Content -->
  <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8 my-8 sm:my-12 pb-24 font-sans">
    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full border border-white/20 bg-[#09090c] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Top header with Title & Return Button -->
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <h1 class="font-sans font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Legal Notices
          </h1>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 font-normal">
            Intellectual Property, Fair Use, and Disclaimers
          </p>
        </div>
        <ReturnButton client:only="react" />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans font-normal">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">1. Trademarks and Brand Ownership</h2>
          <p>
            All third-party video game titles, publisher and developer names, character names, logos, platform marks (such as Steam, Valve, itch.io, GOG, Epic Games, Sony PlayStation, Microsoft Xbox, and Nintendo), and related promotional materials are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners.
          </p>
          <p>
            hoGAMEGATA is an independent reference catalog and discovery archive. It is not affiliated with, authorized by, sponsored by, or officially connected with any game developer, publisher, or digital storefront listed on this website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">2. Fair Use and Archival Media</h2>
          <p>
            Game cover art, screenshots, banner graphics, and trailers featured in our directory are displayed strictly for descriptive, educational, and archival purposes.
          </p>
          <p>
            We use these assets in accordance with the Fair Use principles of United States copyright law (17 U.S.C. § 107) and international fair dealing provisions. They serve as visual reference points to help horror game enthusiasts and researchers identify, study, and discover creative titles across gaming history.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">3. Proprietary Methodologies and Database Structure</h2>
          <p>
            hoGAMEGATA owns all rights to its custom code, database designs, interface layouts, and editorial scoring systems. This includes our multi-factor Scare Meter ratings, fear intensity classifications, taxonomy scoring algorithms, and curated fear tags.
          </p>
          <p>
            You may not scrape or replicate our scoring models or compile bulk database extracts for commercial resale or competing directories without written permission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">4. External Storefronts and Disclaimer of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            Catalog records, hardware requirements, pricing histories, and outbound store links are compiled as an informational convenience. hoGAMEGATA operates strictly as an independent directory.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not sell games, process customer payments, or deliver game files. Following external links to platforms such as Steam, itch.io, GOG, or the Epic Games Store places you under the policies and agreements of those third-party providers. We accept no responsibility or liability for transactions, software downloads, account actions, or product availability on third-party sites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">5. Copyright Inquiries and Takedown Requests (DMCA)</h2>
          <p>
            We respect the intellectual property of developers and artists. If you are a copyright holder or authorized representative and believe that material on hoGAMEGATA infringes your copyright, or if you would like your game removed from the directory, please email our team directly:
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4 text-sm font-sans space-y-1 text-neutral-200">
            <p><strong class="text-white">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@gamegata.xyz" class="text-white underline hover:text-neutral-300">hello@gamegata.xyz</a></p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Subject:</strong> Copyright Notice / Takedown Request</p>
          </div>
          <p>Please include the following information in your request:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-400">
            <li>The URL of the specific game page or asset on hoGAMEGATA.</li>
            <li>Proof of your ownership or authorization to act on behalf of the copyright owner.</li>
            <li>A brief statement identifying the material to be updated or removed.</li>
            <li>Your contact information so we can confirm resolution.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We handle valid requests promptly, typically within 48 to 72 hours. You can also submit updates or requests through our <a href="/submit-game" class="text-white underline hover:text-neutral-100">Developer Portal</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer inside card -->
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6 font-sans text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-2 w-full">
        <span>© 2026 hoGAMEGATA Project</span>
        <span>Effective Date: September 2026</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
